.modal-header
    .modal-identity
        small.text-muted {{scopeName}}
        h3#mcp-batch-title.m-0(translate) Batch configure connection capabilities
    button.btn.btn-secondary.modal-close(type='button', (click)='modal.dismiss()', [attr.aria-label]='"Close" | translate')
        i.fas.fa-times(aria-hidden='true')
.modal-body
    p.text-muted(translate) Applies independent overrides to the selected existing connections. Group templates and new connections are unaffected.
    .batch-capabilities
        .batch-capability(*ngFor='let capability of capabilities')
            .capability-title
                label
                    input.form-check-input.me-2(type='checkbox', [ngModel]='enabled.includes(capability.id)', (ngModelChange)='toggle(capability.id, $event)')
                    span {{capability.label | translate}}
                mcp-capability-help([capability]='capability')
            small.text-muted {{capability.description | translate}}
    h5.mt-4(translate) Apply to these connections
    ul.batch-targets
        li(*ngFor='let connection of connections') {{connectionPath(connection)}}
.modal-footer
    button.btn.btn-secondary(type='button', (click)='modal.dismiss()', translate) Cancel
    button.btn.btn-primary(type='button', (click)='modal.close(enabled)', [disabled]='!connections.length', translate='Apply to {count} connections', [translateParams]='{count: connections.length}')
